usage: calibrate_temporal_scale [-h] --config CONFIG [--admission ADMISSION]
                                [--admission-sha256 ADMISSION_SHA256]
                                {validate,measure}

Bounded one-shot ST loss/shared-gradient measurement, without optimizer
updates. validate reads controls only. measure needs a separate Lead-owned GPU
admission; this tool neither launches workers nor allocates a cache/checkpoint
bank.

positional arguments:
  {validate,measure}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG
  --admission ADMISSION
  --admission-sha256 ADMISSION_SHA256
